        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Aldo Bensadoun\n- Companies: ALDO Group\n- Places: Montreal, Quebec, Canada; Algeria\n- Roles: businessman, investor, philanthropist, founder, executive chairman\n\nFacts:\n- Aldo Bensadoun is an Algerian-Canadian businessman, investor, and philanthropist.\n- In 1972, Aldo Bensadoun founded the ALDO Group in Montreal, Quebec, Canada.\n- Aldo Bensadoun is the founder and executive chairman of the ALDO Group.\n- The ALDO Group is a Canadian Moroccan retailer that owns and operates a worldwide chain of shoe and accessories stores.\n- The ALDO Group is based in Montreal, Quebec, Canada, and its corporate headquarters have remained there since its founding.",
